  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NUFDZAKS/4c2ae7ef695e568902814ab197689b922e530236_96.webp\" alt=\"Beltborne Lanterns 圖標\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fbeltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://discord.gg/9JRb3JMAD3\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"48\"> </a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns?display_name=release&sort=semver&style=flat-square&color=00ae5d\" alt=\"最新版本\"></p>\n<h1>Beltborne Lanterns &mdash; 解放雙手，照亮前路</h1>\n<p>手持燈籠時按下 <strong>B</strong> 鍵 &mdash; 它會扣在腰帶上。行走、跳躍、戰鬥 &mdash; 燈籠會<strong>隨物理引擎擺動</strong>並<em>在你身邊發出光亮。</em> 想拿回手中？再按一次 <strong>B</strong> 即可。💡</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🧩 為什麼它很棒</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一鍵操作，零麻煩。</strong> 不用再翻背包：<strong>B</strong> 鍵可瞬間掛上或卸下燈籠。</li>\n<li><strong>生動的燈光。</strong> 物理效果讓光暈更具真實感 &mdash; 移動與轉身時會輕輕擺動。</li>\n<li><strong>沉浸體驗不妥協。</strong> 雙手解放，燈光相伴 &mdash; 探索、建造、生存。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚙️ 使用方式&nbsp;</h2>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">手持燈籠。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">按下 <strong>B</strong> &mdash; 它會扣在腰帶上。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">四處走動 &mdash; 它會與你同步擺動並<em>在你身邊發光。</em></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">再次按下 <strong>B</strong> &mdash; 它會卸下。<br><br></li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>動態光照提示：</em> 遊戲內的光照效果需要搭配動態光照模組 &mdash; 請見常見問題。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>⧉ 擴充模組</h2>\n<p><strong>Beltborne Lanterns - Accessories Layer</strong>&nbsp;： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📷 實機畫面</h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo1.webp\" alt=\"展示 1\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo2.webp\" alt=\"展示 2\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo3.webp\" alt=\"展示 3\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo4.webp\" alt=\"展示 4\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo5.webp\" alt=\"展示 5\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo6.webp\" alt=\"展示 6\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<hr>\n<h2>❓ 常見問題 &mdash; 相容性與多人遊戲</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>支援多人遊戲嗎？</strong> &mdash; <strong>支援！</strong><em>（需同時安裝於客戶端與伺服器）</em></li>\n<li><strong>原版 Minecraft 中會發光嗎？</strong> &mdash; <strong>不會。</strong> 若要讓腰帶燈籠發光，請安裝動態光照模組：\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fabric / Quilt / NeoForge</strong>&nbsp;：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a></li>\n<li><strong>替代方案 (NeoForge)</strong>&nbsp;：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Lights (AtomicStryker)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>能與靈魂燈籠（Soul Lantern）相容嗎？</strong> &mdash; <strong>可以！</strong></li>\n<li><strong>能與其他模組的燈籠相容嗎？</strong> &mdash; <strong>可以！</strong> 請將其 <strong>物品標籤（item tag）</strong> 加入設定檔的相容列表中。</li>\n<li><strong>能與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a> 相容嗎？</strong> &mdash; <strong>可以</strong>，請安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Beltborne Lanterns: Accessories Layer</strong></a> 擴充模組。</li>\n<li><strong>能與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffirst-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">First-person Model</a> 相容嗎？</strong> &mdash;&nbsp;<strong>可以</strong>，而且效果非常棒！&nbsp;<em>（截圖位於隱藏內容中）</em>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/152920d7a3299d971640438bc0bbb7eaea029728.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>📜 授權條款</h2>\n<p>本專案採用 <strong>Apache License 2.0</strong> 授權 &mdash; 詳細資訊請參見 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns/settings/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 檔案。<br>完整授權文本：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache 2.0</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">為 Minecraft 社群用心打造 ❤️</p>",
